# While job sector may indirectly relate to income, credit card approval decisions typically rely more on direct metrics (e.g., Debt, Income, Employment Stability). Without specific mappings (e.g., high-risk sectors), this feature offers limited predictive power.
df.drop(columns=['Industry'], inplace=True)
end

